      "start_seconds": 240.66,
      "end_seconds": 264.81,
      "duration_seconds": 24.15,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It points towards bleeding in early pregnancy that needs a scan. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had some bleeding for two days, and no fainting or shoulder tip pain."
