      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.35,
      "end_seconds": 293.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "let's get a pregnancy hormone level, for bleeding in early pregnancy use pads rather than tampons and avoid intercourse until the scan"
